WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,230
Ancestor, let’s just take the space directly.

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:10,110
Stupid mouse, although everyone is very reliable, we still have to be cautious.

3
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:14,110
We have been through so many things together, so when we are tired, we will take it back and eat it with everyone.

4
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:21,470
I don't have any wages to give you

5
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:25,740
No charge, thank you

6
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:32,030
I'm just here to talk

7
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:36,000
Where are you going?

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,110
Why do you ask this?

9
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:42,970
By the way

10
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:48,690
Can walk together for a while

11
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:52,690
You don't want to offset that requirement by traveling with you for a while, do you?

12
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,290
It's not impossible

13
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:57,280
I don’t know the specific route. Ask Sister Wang.

14
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:00,160
Your team will have to take care of us during the journey, no problem
